{"quest_id": 6565, "name": "地底に眠るくぐつ", "description": "爆音によって眠りから覚めた古代の遺物が\n王子たちに襲い掛かる。\n暴走し、自爆する機甲兵たちを鎮圧せよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "浮遊石とドワーフの養娘", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920114, "map_no": 3303, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "exp": 250, "gold": 1000, "drops": [{"card": 153, "c": 1}, {"card": 204, "c": 1}, {"card": 59, "c": 1}, {"item": 2001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 2}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 33, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 191, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100768, "change_to": 1, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 31254, "global_id": 4873, "to_condition": 0, "to_global_id": 283, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 2600}]}, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 250, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 121, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100768, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 284, "global_id": 283, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 0}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 120, "attack_wait": 45, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100816, "special_effect_id": 241, "master_id": 291, "global_id": 290, "spawn_sec": 6}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 550, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 550, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_speed": 120, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 211, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2102960, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 225, "change_to": 4, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 31255, "global_id": 4874, "to_condition": 0, "to_global_id": 1055, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 20}]}, "spawn_sec": 134}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 550, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 550, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "attack_range": 180, "attack_speed": 120, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 91, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2102960, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 225, "missile_id": 26, "master_id": 10056, "global_id": 1055, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 0}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "グスタフ", "text": "おぉ、こっちじゃこっちじゃ！", "face": "u153"}, {"name": "リッカ", "text": "グスタフさん！\nえぇと、その大量の爆薬はいったい……？", "face": "u152"}, {"name": "グスタフ", "text": "いや何、『浮遊石』鉱脈への、\n近道を作ってやろうかと思っての。\nこうして準備をしていたんじゃ。", "face": "u153"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "それはありがたいけど……グスタフのジジィが、\nこうして張り切ってる時って、\nいつも何かろくでもない事が起きるんだよなぁ。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "グスタフ", "text": "今回は何も起こらんわい！\nそれじゃあ行くぞ、耳を塞いで口を半開きにせい！\nせーの……発破ァ！！", "face": "u153"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "きゃぁああっ！？", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "けほっ、けほっ……。\nまったく、もうちょっとタイミングってものを……って、\nほ、ほら言わんことじゃねぇ！！", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "リッカ", "text": "穴の奥に見えるの……あれ機甲兵ですよ！", "face": "u152"}, {"name": "グスタフ", "text": "採掘を続けていたら、\nいつかは遭遇していたんじゃ。\n早いか遅いかじゃろう。はっはっは。", "face": "u153"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "まったく、困ったジジィだぜ……。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "リッカ", "text": "王子、機甲兵の中には自爆する個体もいます。\n十分に警戒して迎撃してください！", "face": "u152"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "リッカ", "text": "ふぅ……何とか片付きましたね。", "face": "u152"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "グスタフさん、\n次からは相談してからにしてくださいね？", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "…………ん？\nおいジジィ、ありゃ何だ？\nこんな洞穴見たこと無いぞ？", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "グスタフさんの開けた穴の向こうに、\n別の洞穴が広がってるみたいですね。", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "グスタフ", "text": "これは……人工の洞穴じゃな。\n何者かが掘り進んだ跡があるぞい。", "face": "u153"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ドワーフの皆さんが掘った洞窟ではない、\nとなると、魔物が潜んでいる可能性もありますね。", "face": "l031151a3e8d0"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、安全確保の為にも、\n一度調査してはいかがでしょうか？", "face": "l031151a3e8d0"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "よぉし、そうとなりゃ乗り込むぜ！\n足場が悪いから注意してついてきな！", "face": "u672"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920114_3303", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 23, "y": 357}, {"k": "b", "x": 931, "y": 348}, {"k": "m", "x": 148, "y": 309, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 145, "y": 403, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 251, "y": 399, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 798, "y": 317, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 812, "y": 413, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 358, "y": 400, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 337, "y": 312, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 705, "y": 324, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 499, "y": 231, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 596, "y": 239, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 404, "y": 229, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 615, "y": 313, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 591, "y": 403, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 556, "y": 178, "id": 213}, {"k": "r", "x": 140, "y": 495, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 459, "y": 468, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 584, "y": 483, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 740, "y": 258, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 234, "y": 224, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 333, "y": 223, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 443, "y": 183, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 698, "y": 521, "id": 307}, {"k":